# `typebox` and the `@earendil-works/*` packages are provided by the host Pi
# process at load time and are declared as peerDependencies. npm 7+ installs
# peer dependencies by default, which would copy host-provided packages into this
# package's node_modules — Pi warns about that ("Installed copies can bypass the
# extension loader and create duplicate runtime modules"). Install without peers.
omit=peer=true